Author: zurich-maps-2 <zurich-maps-2@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Sun Oct 18 21:51:22 2026 +0000

    fix(map,results,search): stale edition tiles, year debounce, badge contrast, a11y

    - map.js: include the WMTS Time dimension in the tile cache key and clear the
      overlay DOM when layer/edition changes. Before, moving the Zeitreise edition
      updated the label but kept showing the previous edition's tiles (verified in
      headless Chromium: 1900 -> 1944 now reloads 1944/{TileMatrix} URLs).
    - map.js: role=region + aria-roledescription instead of role=application (screen
      readers no longer switch into application mode for the whole map); arrow keys
      pan only while the map region itself has focus, not on a focused marker.
    - results.js: one shared debounce dropped the first patch when 'von' and 'bis'
      were edited in quick succession; commit both fields from one debounced reader.
    - results.js: the edition default and a new 'Ausgabe für <year>' chip follow the
      selected publication period instead of always starting at the oldest edition.
    - search.js: de-duplicate swisstopo's repeated gazetteer labels, expose busy
      state, support Home/End in the listbox, and open the record when a 'Datensatz'
      suggestion is chosen.
    - app.css: '.map-badge .zh-tag' overrode the solid tag's black fill, leaving
      white text on white (contrast failure) – exclude '.zh-tag--solid'. Map is
      56vh with touch-action:pan-y on coarse pointers so vertical swipes still
      scroll the page instead of trapping it.

